description_en:
Combat Action: When your active character is Nahida, equip this card.
After Nahida equips this card, immediately use Illusory Heart once.
While your Nahida, who has this card equipped, is on the field, the following effects are granted based on the Elemental Types in your party:
Pyro: While Shrine of Maya is on the field, when an opposing character triggers Seed of Skandha due to an Elemental Reaction, the Piercing DMG they take from Seed of Skandha is converted to Dendro DMG;
Electro: When Shrine of Maya enters play, the Seed of Skandha currently attached to opposing characters gains Usage(s) +1;
Hydro: The Shrine of Maya created by your Nahida, who has this card equipped, has its initial Duration (Rounds) +1.

